# Source Component

Notification channel adapter implementations that handle the actual delivery of monitoring events to external services.

## Key Integration Pattern
Each source adapter (Discord, Telegram, SES, SMTP) implements the Source interface with channel-specific formatting and delivery logic.

## Important Constraints
- Configure retry logic with exponential backoff for transient failures
- Implement rate limiting to respect external service quotas
- Format event data according to each channel's constraints (e.g., Discord embeds, Telegram markdown)